- **Tests**: `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/tests/validate-alignment-no-task-policy.test.ts`

### 7. **Schema Definition**

From `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/src/schema/common.ts`:

